 4. 🕔 After hours: &quot;Bunker essentials&quot; 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Photo: Justin Sullivan/Getty Images

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Surviving the apocalypse is getting more expensive. 

 😧 Prices of "bunker essentials" — the stuff you might need to survive a doomsday scenario — are spiking after a bunch of tech failures unnerved Americans, Bloomberg reports . 💸 Zoom in: Online prices of freeze-dried food — "a staple of any bunker pantry," as Bloomberg notes — have spiked 12% since September. 

 Generators are selling fast and getting costlier, while paper towels and batteries are also getting more expensive. Coby Coonradt, co-host of the "Casual Preppers Podcast," said downloads have increased 33% over the last month. 💭 Nathan's thought bubble: I've decided that in the event of the apocalypse, I'm ready to go — save yourselves. 

 
 
